items.CozyRanch_Feed_Hearty.name=Hearty Feed
items.CozyRanch_Feed_Hearty.description=A filling mix of grain and potato. Animals stay well fed for longer. Put it in a trough or give it by hand.
items.CozyRanch_Feed_Sweet.name=Sweet Feed
items.CozyRanch_Feed_Sweet.description=Carrot and pumpkin treats. Animals warm up to you faster for a while. Put it in a trough or give it by hand.
items.CozyRanch_Feed_Breeders.name=Breeder's Feed
items.CozyRanch_Feed_Breeders.description=Fresh greens that get animals ready to breed again sooner. Put it in a trough or give it by hand.
items.CozyRanch_Feed_Premium.name=Premium Feed
items.CozyRanch_Feed_Premium.description=The finest crops of the farm. Animals produce a little more for a while. Put it in a trough or give it by hand.
items.CozyRanch_Toy_Ball.name=Play Ball
